Recommends: python3-mygpoclient
Description: Podcast client for Maemo Leste (gPodder 4)
 The podcast client of Maemo 5, brought up to date for Maemo Leste: the
 current gPodder 4 core (gpodder-core 4.17.2 with podcastparser and minidb,
 as used by gPodder for Sailfish OS 4.18.1) with the touch QML UI of
 gpodder-ui-qml, on PyOtherSide and Qt 5.
XB-Maemo-Display-Name: gPodder
